# The built artifact is committed, as it is in every other project here:
# the org's showcase clones repos and opens index.html directly, and the
# offline-proof check reads that file from the clone. A build product a
# reader needs is not a scratch file. check.sh rebuilds it before testing,
# so a stale commit is caught rather than shipped.
.tmp/
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
